
The Center for Disability Services is looking for a paid or volunteer note taker for this class.

The Center will pay $50 (for handwritten notes) or $75 (for typed and emailed notes) for the semester on a contractual basis.  In order to qualify for full payment, you must sign a contract within 7 days.




 You must be willing to:
*      Attend every scheduled class and be on time
*         Take notes on NCR Paper, provided by CDS, or make copies of the notes at the CDS office at least once per week, or email the typed notes to the CDS office at notes@disability.utah.edu<mailto:notes@disability.utah.edu>.

If you are interested in providing this service, please contact Suzanne Eastmond, Administrative Assistant, at (801) 581-5020, email notes@disability.utah.edu<mailto:notes@disability.utah.edu>, or come to our office (162 Union) as soon as possible to set up the contract and complete the necessary paperwork.

